## Enable ssh control via resource manager

An additional optional customization that is recommended is to restrict `ssh`
access on compute nodes to only allow access by users who have an active job
associated with the node. This can be enabled via the use of a pluggable
authentication module (PAM) provided as part of the Slurm package installs. To
enable this feature on *compute* nodes, issue the following:

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
<!-- ohpc_comment Enable slurm pam module -->
```bash
{{ compute_echo("account    required     pam_slurm.so", "/etc/pam.d/sshd") }}
```
<!-- ohpc_end -->
